{"title": "Pushing Attack (Ranged)", "pageid": 1486, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Pushing_Attack_(Ranged)", "categories": ["Weapon actions", "Strength saving throws", "Actions", "Combat manoeuvres", "Actions that push or pull"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Pushing_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Pushing Attack (Melee)\">Pushing Attack (Melee)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Pushing_Attack_(Titanstring_Bow)\" title=\"Pushing Attack (Titanstring Bow)\">Pushing Attack (Titanstring Bow)</a>      </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Pushing_Attack_Ranged.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Pushing_Attack_Ranged.webp/300px-Pushing_Attack_Ranged.webp, /w/images/a/aa/Pushing_Attack_Ranged.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Pushing_Attack_Ranged.webp/300px-Pushing_Attack_Ranged.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Pushing_Attack_Ranged.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Pushing Attack (Ranged)</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master\" title=\"Battle Master\">Battle Master</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Fighter\" title=\"Fighter\">Fighter</a> class action. This combat manoeuvre allows the Fighter to deal damage to enemies with Ranged Weapons and push them away.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSpend a superiority die to deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Physical\" title=\"Physical\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Physical\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Physical\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Physical\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">Physical</span></a> damage and possibly push the target back 4.5 m (15 ft).<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Cost on hit</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/25px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/38px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/25px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Superiority_Die\" title=\"Superiority Die\">Superiority Die</a></dd><dt>Damage</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Normal weapon damage</div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> + <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/25px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/38px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Superiority Die d8 Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/25px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Battlemaster#Superiority_dice\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Battlemaster\">Superiority Die</a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" 