/a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">RangeIgnoreVerticalThreshold</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master\" title=\"Battle Master\">Battle Master</a></li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Adept\" title=\"Martial Adept\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Martial_Adept_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Adept_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Martial_Adept_Icon.webp/38px-Martial_Adept_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Martial_Adept_Icon.webp/50px-Martial_Adept_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Adept\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Martial_Adept_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Adept_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Martial_Adept_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Adept\" title=\"Martial Adept\">Martial Adept</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The knockback is a separate <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Weapon Action DC Strength Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Weapon Action DC</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> that can fail even if the attack roll succeeds.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715051620\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2884/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48656/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16873/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1437037/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.770      1 -total\n 98.65%   61.921      1 Template:Feature_page\n 91.48%   57.421     38 Template:Trim\n 17.71%   11.115      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 17.30%   10.861      7 Template:Icon_text\n 13.11%    8.231      2 Template:Resource\n 10.18%    6.389      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.98%    5.640      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  7.03%    4.410      1 Template:PageSeo\n  6.22%    3.903      1 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:1486-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715051620 and revision id 374766. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}